  m_Text: Connect the input arrow to the source workstation and the output arrow
    to the receiving station or another belt's input. A workstation can face any
    direction. Documents stay at the source until the whole route ends at a matching
    station with room, or Delivery. Tap the surface move icon to reposition a belt.
